<title>USA: M.G. Products moves to OTC Bulletin Board.</title>
<headline>M.G. Products moves to OTC Bulletin Board.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>M.G. Products Inc said on Thursday that its company's common stock will be listed on the OTC Bulletin Board Service of the National Association of Securities Dealers and no longer be included in the Nasdaq SmallCap market, effective September 27.</p>
</text>
